                            "The Geph network is now its own app on the home screen, running Geph's own unmodified engine, whose signature is checked before it is installed. The whole phone goes through the tunnel, IPv6 included, so nothing leaves on your own line. When the network changes or the engine stops, the engine comes back up while the tunnel stays open. It shows \"connected\" only after a real request has crossed the tunnel.\n\nFeatures: a free account or sign-in with an account code, account type and expiry, data left, a new code, free and gift codes, exit country and city, finding the fastest server, a speed test, direct connection to the exit, ad and adult filters, proxy-only mode, port forwarding, LAN sharing, Geph news, and sessions with a live log. There is no purchase in the app.",
